{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>StillRead 是一款離線優先的私人閱讀器，適合重視書籍與閱讀紀錄私隱、不想建立帳戶的讀者；現以<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>提供，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-161.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線私密閱讀</h2>\n<p>可從檔案、郵件、Safari 或 Finder 檔案共享匯入 EPUB、PDF 與 TXT 書籍，無需建立帳戶，書籍、進度、書籤、標記及設定均留在裝置。提供繼續閱讀捷徑、EPUB 與 TXT 書內搜尋、字體與主題調整、裝置上朗讀、自動捲動，以及閱讀時間估算與簡單統計，全程無廣告、訂閱、分析或第三方 SDK。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-6-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-7-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-8-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-9-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-10-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-11-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：StillRead: Private Reader</li><li>應用類別：Book</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/stillread-private-reader/id6800770327?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T23:26:02.390479+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:07:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:58:04.346045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T23:19:25.393833+00:00","content_hash":"425f48dc47c5bd93e6c8ecdc74beb0abbd56df5197c2d010be4c916da93ad587","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}